          "name": "In Destination Size",
          "type": "DestinationSize ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In User Data",
          "type": "UserData ("
        },
        {
          "name": "In Priority",
          "type": "Priority ("
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "The scatter-gather parameters specifies the I/O store encoded block boundaries,\nwhether the block is compressed and or encrypted, whether to check the block\nsignature hash and from where in the uncompressed block to copy the block data\nto the destination buffer."
